  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Using the HISP-model to build digital public infrastructure capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will leverage the approach used in the Health Information Systems Program managed by the University of Oslo, and the global HISP community that UiO coordinates, as a highly relevant and cost-effective mechanism for supporting countries to build out their digital public infrastructure based on digital public goods. UiO has world class experience through supporting more than 70 countries to implement the digital public good DHIS2 since the 1990s. s</narrative>
  </description>
